33724,"Democratic presidential candidate Hillary Clinton said Sunday that the United States is ""not winning"" the battle against the Islamic State and called on Congress to update the use-of-force authorization passed after Sept. 11, 2001, to give President Obama more options to fight the militant group. But she stopped short of calling for a declaration of war.

